      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <description>Restaurant Name:
Aranyszarvas Vendéglö

Type:
Local

Description:
This building from the beginning of the 18th century has been a restaurant and a pub for centuries. The menu still propose typical game-dishes...
At walking distance from Castle hill, this is a very authentic restaurant with quality food...Even better, the prices there are far from the over-priced restaurant of the touristic area...
A definite must-do...

Favorite Dish:
I had venison, totally unusual for me but delicious...

Prices:
US$21-30

&gt; Currency Converter
Comparative Price:
less expensive than average

Customer Satisfaction:
 A Great Experience.

Address:
Szarvas tér, 1 at the beginning of Atilla út

Directions:
At the foot of Caste Hill, south-east side of the Royal Palace, far from the touristic area

Phone:
(+36-1) 375-6451</description>
      <name>Aranyszarvas Vendéglö</name>
