    <Placemark>
      <description>Belgian Brasserie
I. Bem rakpart 12, Tel: 201 5082, Open: noon-12am daily, No credit cards, Metro: M2 Batthyány tér, Tram 19, Show Map 
With draught Hoegaarden and bottled Chimay on offer, fans of Belgian beer will have reason enough to visit this likeable restaurant in Buda. Of course, the food here is none too bad either, with traditional Belgian staples (such as moules marinière) cooked with some aplomb. Not too pricey and well-worth considering if you&apos;re in the vicinity of Batthyány Square.</description>
      <name>Belgian Brasserie Henri</name>
