    <Placemark>
      <description>(Royal Palace, Castle District, Trinity Square, Matthias Church, Fishermen&apos;s Bastion, Mary Magdalene Tower, Cave system.) The name Buda Castle covers more than a castle or the Royal Palace in the capital city; it extends to the historical quarter full of sites. On bright spring days people invite friends for a &quot;walk in the Castle&quot;, i.e. to wander around the Castle Hill quarter. The most exciting way of getting to the Castle is by taking the Funicular, a little cable car up the Castle Hill.</description>
      <name>Buda Castle</name>
