    <Placemark>
      <description>(XIII. Váci út 19.)
Central Europe&apos;s first interactive, scientific playhouse with more than 100 spectacular, hands-on scientific games and experiments over an area of 1000 m2. The interactive playhouse offers practical science for both younger and older kids, who may try out the &quot;miracle bicycle&quot;, and numerous visual effects.

Open:

7. Sept. - 20. Aug.
Monday -Friday 9.00-17.00,
Saturday, Sunday 10.00-18.00;</description>
      <name>Palace of Miracles</name>
