      <description>VI. Lovag u. 5, Tel: 268 0801, 268 0802, E-mail: juliska@neworleans.hu, Website: www.neworleans.hu, Open: 6pm-2am daily (for gig details Tel: 451 7525), Metro: Metro: M3 Arany János u./M3 Nyugati pu., Show Map
Large restaurant/club venue that not only draws top-notch music acts from the US (and around the world) but also offers a tempting array of Louisiana signature dishes  - such as chicken jambalaya - together with Tex-Mex style hamburgers, steaks and burritos (including vegetarian options). Lots of cocktails and spirits, with Budweiser on tap too.</description>
